	| Last Name     | Employee2                        |
	| Group         | Employees                        |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "pro.employee1@liferay.com.broken" added via automatic sync
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "pro.employee2@liferay.com.broken" added via automatic sync
